        "payload": "tree 40b2451d39b7d16ac4cf11432650366a08ddf43a\nparent a9d2316b50acff4c1b490fa08f47584bb6b1f27d\nauthor Kanan <93033289+kriss39@users.noreply.github.com> 1790433991 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790433991 +0400\n\ncli: don't time out at all for -rpcclienttimeout=0\n\nbitcoin-cli used a 5 year timeout for -rpcclienttimeout=0, a leftover\nfrom libevent, which had no way to wait without a limit. With the cap\nin Sock::WaitMany, a single wait now ends after about 24.8 days, and\nHTTPClient::Recv treats that as a timeout.\n\nAdd Sock::NO_TIMEOUT, which WaitMany passes to poll() as -1 and to\nselect() as a null pointer, so both block until an event occurs. Use\nit in bitcoin-cli when -rpcclienttimeout is 0.",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt9rHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0FEQABSmmDvT+QN3g/hTYtCHkg8m\n1vsSQI+D+rYVsY1NF4boWBsjEerD1IZUModVdKfILCd/BV+EbFu5S4l49LLH/HNZ\np3jnxRom1LkR7zoWrM7jLap8HhBypaGaqUN3htVlUoxeHs0CWn6EuEiaHgzZX5UX\nzpdfmjrQhQrCg11GZnO5gQEDB2EVVLORL5E36BE70mnjjrt/KdY2o+KyDMIcyl1m\nmmMIaS1IRzENbX8GdQARpRwEATp6d94zOTQJCF/FnPKStiEr+IXhThcmVoI13ves\nJnhgaOgvBjFD7Dl6Jyry97v5Gn1MDT8FogUlFmIIcUyuAODY+px97/71bR2OBn2e\nkOeCXLpO2AVRHSOSCldS/2CUgVtOK360fBoRgnmTDy/QAs0vt3FK56IvB+VjOmH2\nal4iVv2bOD4nM+loiNoJ5BypgGAd7qbhkt9ytmejT4fTRlXC6b3k87q9rA/4ZSj+\nizzZe5eDZtwoPFOgDOCTiyZWqeLBhVLx44O8g3VPrMq+Glg99Biul0aIMu9MTrid\n1mG3E8n8CJJx98h9i1RMEYEp3IEIJOmSzK1b1bI5G7u3AvA5tYFiyj0ofvaF9R6/\nlWmhPGwqAPa11I2lrTi93U1Mhc1bpa/e1cB5+29ApvzT3PI/zDm/l+cpKMF1qjrF\ngirbHKKPTCvdBXz7QjdS\n=29bn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n"
